<title>BULGARIA: Macedonia forex reserves fall to $249 mln in Sept.</title>
<headline>Macedonia forex reserves fall to $249 mln in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macedonia's foreign exchange reserves fell to $249.5 million on September 30 from $255.5 million in August, the National Bank of Macedonia (NBM) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Reserves have fallen by $6 million due to occasional interventions on the local interbank forex market to service final clients such as fuel importers, the NBM said.</p>
<p> NBM FX RESERVES,    (SEPT)    (AUG)	 (SEPT 95)</p>
<p> MLN USD		 249.5     255.5	    239.0</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-328-101</p>
